  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "effb741f3363f6b9",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2 是由 Google DeepMind 构建的开放多模态嵌入模型，它将文本（包括代码）、图像、视频和音频输入——及其组合——映射到一个统一的 768 维向量空间。该模型共有 740M 参数，由一个 270M 参数的文本模块与可选的视觉（170M）和音频（300M）编码器组合而成。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85e97604a1dff366",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2 专为在移动设备和笔记本等消费级硬件上运行而设计，可为设备端应用（如搜索、检索增强生成（RAG）、分类和聚类）提供低延迟的语义表示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2fe2e2d2353cc45",
      "translationZh": "EmbeddingGemma 2 在 Gemma 4 的架构和能力进步基础上构建，提供了以下几个核心特性：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44201ad1f4d9ff1b",
      "translationZh": "原生多模态：原生多模态：在一个共享的 768 维嵌入空间中统一 4 种模态（文本、图像、视频和音频）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "770259d454b8b1ba",
      "translationZh": "多语言和代码：EmbeddingGemma 2 理解 100+ 种语言，并在代码任务上相比前身实现 ~14% 的提升。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb15d2da4a064f58",
      "translationZh": "灵活占用：结合一个 270M 参数的文本骨干网络（130M Transformer + 140M 嵌入器）与可选择加载的视觉（170M）和音频（300M）编码器，使开发者只需加载其用例所需的模态。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ff93167e8a0b010",
      "translationZh": "Matryoshka 表示学习（MRL）：原生支持 128d、256d、512d 和 768d 的截断嵌入，可在质量影响极小的情况下实现向量存储成本最高降低 6 倍。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "635707d492bf15a2",
      "translationZh": "上下文长度：8K token 上下文窗口，能够处理数分钟的音频或视频。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3dbdb2b0c1196f1b",
      "translationZh": "任务引导表示：使用轻量级文本指令前缀来优化不同任务（搜索、分类、聚类、语义相似等）的嵌入。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1faf29a0dc7afc2c",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp 支持 https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/30054",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
